Z||000000||flexableface||05-09-2000||02:19 AM||||hey this is my first post here. over the weekend i went to a swap meet in southeastern michigan where i live i went to just browse around and check out some nice cars and see if there were any good find at the swap meet. i have been wanting to put a scoop on the deck lid of my car for a while. i found a hood scoop off a trans am 6.6. With a little customizing im going to cut a hole in the deck lid and mount the scoop to let out excess heat from the engine compartment. I hope to put it on this weekend it should look pretty good and help keep the engine compartment cooler. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||flexableface||05-09-2000||02:42 AM||||i was also wondering if any one has ever did this to there fiero and how did it work out.||||reg||1
