Z||000003||stimpy||05-09-2000||06:51 AM||||The T/A scoop would be one of those "shaker" scoops fom the Smokey & the Bandit year T/A, eh? Problem I see is 1. those aren't functional scoops as is from the factory. They are more for show then go. You would ave to cut out the back plate, and knowing my skills, if I did it, it would look pretty rough. 2. they didn't mount on the hood of the T/A, rather they sat on the air cleaner. So again some tricky modifications would have to be done to make it fit...read: mucho bondo.<BR>My personal sggestion would be see if you could adapt it to fit one of the side grills. These grill are relatively plentiful in junkyards and a whole lot more dispensible if ya screw up then a decklid.  ||||reg||1
Z||000004||stimpy||05-09-2000||06:52 AM||||By the way, welcome to the forum!||||reg||1
